    "source_text": "Denmark Discovers Largest Viking Age Silver Treasure.\n\nA gardener in Denmark just unearthed the biggest Viking Age silver treasure ever found in the Nordic region. This remarkable discovery adds a significant piece to the historical puzzle of the Viking era. The treasure's size and the artifacts involved could provide new insights into Viking culture and trade. Such finds often attract archaeologists and history enthusiasts alike. If you want the link, just comment viking.",
