            "topic": "Denmark's largest Viking Age silver hoard, found in a Rebild garden",
            "summary": "A homeowner digging for a new patio in Rebild, North Jutland, uncovered about 18.5 kg of Viking Age silver — roughly 700 objects — making it the largest Viking silver hoard ever found in Denmark, announced 31 August 2026. It is a Danish record, not a Nordic one: Sweden's Spillings Hoard on Gotland weighed about 67 kg.",
